#ASSERT `Am I in time to ask the State Administrative Tribunal for a review` `as the owner` `objection decided` 43 FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Am I in time to ask the State Administrative Tribunal for a review` `as the owner` `objection decided` 43 TRUE EQUALS `yes if` (`Am I in time to apply for a review` 43 TRUE)
#ASSERT `Am I in time to ask the State Administrative Tribunal for a review` `as the owner` `not objected` `an unasked number` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
