#ASSERT `Must I keep paying my rates while my objection is decided` `as the owner` `objection pending` EQUALS `yes if` `Must I still pay while my objection is decided`
#ASSERT `Must I keep paying my rates while my objection is decided` `as the owner` `not objected` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Must I keep paying my rates while my objection is decided` `as the owner` `objection decided` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Must I keep paying my rates while my objection is decided` `as the tenant` `an unasked objection` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

§§ `The tenant or occupier`

§§§ `ss 1.4, 6.38, 6.44`

-- An ordinary tenant of a privately owned house: no. A lessee of Crown land that is rateable only because of the lease
-- is the "owner" (s 1.4 (a)(ii)): yes.
#ASSERT `Am I liable to pay the rates on the land I rent` `as the tenant` FALSE EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Am I liable to pay the rates on the land I rent` `as the tenant` TRUE EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Am I liable to pay the rates on the land I rent` `as the owner` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

#ASSERT `Can I be charged a service charge as the occupier` `as the tenant` EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Can I be charged a service charge as the occupier` `as the owner` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

